{
  "quest.5EDFD69BB6601872.quest_desc": [
    "A new Blood Assembler only handles tier I recipes. &aAra Vitae Tier Cards&r raise the altar tier it can craft for, up to IV.",
    "",
    "&cRecipes that need a tier V altar, such as the Transcendent orb, can't be automated this way.",
    "",
    "Each &aParallel Processing Card&r adds one more craft at a time, up to 4.",
  ],
  "quest.2D254A8045093FED.title": "The Hellfire Forge",
  "quest.191E3A2225AD70FA.title": "The Sentient Shell",
  "quest.5E12FC7FD8720FBA.title": "The Foreman",
  "quest.3F637FF7658CCA33.quest_desc": [
    "&eAnimus&r adds a long list of sigils on top of the ones you already know, each built from its own &cReagent&r in the same way.",
    "",
    "A few worth knowing first:",
    "",
    "- &cSigil of the Phantom Chain&r captures a creature into a &cMob Soul&r, preserving its health, equipment, custom name and AI. It's the cleanest way to move a mob you care about.",
    "- &cSigil of Transposition&r picks up a block whole and puts it down somewhere else.",
    "- &cSigil of Consumption&r turns blocks within 8 blocks into spreading &cAntiLife&r at 25 EV each. Keep it away from your base.",
    "",
    "The Phantom Chain needs a Tier II altar for its &cTabula Animata&r, and its &cReagent: Chains&r needs 128 &dSpiritus&r in the forge's gem, more than a Petty Spiritus Gem holds.",
    "",
    "&7&oCheck the Codex for the full catalog, there are far more than are worth listing here.&r",
  ],
  "quest.2507A7FD69022F2C.quest_desc": [
    "Burn Spiritus in the &cVas Maleficum&r and the air of the chunk grows thick with will. Read it with the &cSpiritus Aura Gauge&r.",
  ],
  "quest.3EC0F38A5F8D01E2.quest_desc": [
    "Your first act as a &bVitaemancer&r is to construct an &aAra Vitae&r.",
    "",
    "Place it on flat stone where you can reach every side. With no Essentia Vitae of its own, the altar draws blood from any nearby who carry no &2Blood Orb&r, refining it into &bEV&r. It never kills; it takes only what it needs.",
    "",
    "[\"\", \"Rituals and the blood you give also level your \", {\"text\": \"Magic skill tree\", \"color\": \"aqua\", \"underlined\": true, \"click_event\": {\"action\": \"custom\", \"id\": \"ftbquests:docs\", \"payload\": {\"location\": \"guideme,ftb:skills,ftb:magic.md\"}}, \"hover_event\": {\"action\": \"show_text\", \"value\": \"Open the Skill Trees guide\"}}, \".\"]",
  ],
  "quest.19A36A138537D911.quest_desc": [
    "Each Deus ritual is a stronger form of one you already know, its circle wrapped in an outer crown of &cDeus Ritual Stones&r. They answer to the same Spiritus as their lesser forms.",
    "",
    "Build any Deus ritual and wake it with your Divinus Activation Crystal. The next page lists what each one does.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "- &cDeus Well of Suffering&r: reaches 32 blocks, and every wound yields twice the Essentia Vitae.",
    "- &cDeus Torment Nexus&r: finds spawners up to 64 blocks away, rolls three times the loot, and each simulated kill costs under half the EV.",
    "- &cDeus Endless Quarry&r: moves four times the ore each pulse. Choose Silk Touch or Fortune III in the Ritual Configurator.",
    "- &cDeus Crystallum Fractura&r: crystals grow four times as fast across a 31-wide area, and every harvest gets Fortune III at no Spiritus cost.",
    "- &cDeus Overgrowth&r: tends three times the area and pulses twice as often before any Spiritus is added.",
    "- &cDeus Mason&r: lays eight times as many blocks each pulse, across four times the volume and twice the reach.",
    "- &cDeus Fallen Trees&r: fells up to 512 blocks an operation across a 41-wide area, replanting as it goes.",
    "- &cDeus Meteo&r: calls the same meteors as the Ritual of Meteo, with pure ore in place of every filler stone.",
  ],
  "quest.3198863667151E85.quest_desc": [
    "A full &cMaster Ritual Stone&r wants a diagram, a stack of runes and real planning. An &cImperfect Ritual Stone&r wants one block and a right-click.",
    "",
    "Place a block on top of the stone and right-click it. Which block you used decides which rite you get, and the stone survives to be used again.",
    "",
    "&cAncient Debris&r gives you the &cImperfect Ritual of Boundless Skies&r. That buys fifteen minutes of creative flight for &c10,000 EV&r a go, reapplied whenever you like before it runs out.",
    "",
    "There are around a dozen of these covering flight, hunger, weather, enhancement and more.",
    "",
    "&7&oThey're cheap to set up and expensive to fire. Check your reserves before calling one.&r",
  ],
  "quest.22AE6BD2B6F44124.title": "&cThe Sanguine Rectifier",
  "quest.1FB8BF0898FD99D9.quest_desc": [
    "Twenty-four runes and four pillars capped in &bBlood Stained Glass&r raise the altar to &cTier II&r, where it can craft the &cVeneficus Orb of Vitae&r.",
    "",
    "At Tier II the altar stops being a tool and becomes an engine.",
  ],
  "quest.6C79D3E7AD6D6766.quest_desc": [
    "Inscribe upgrades onto your shell with &cUpgrade Tomes&r. Right-click to add a level; sneak and use to add the maximum at once.",
    "",
    "Body Builder, Repair, Fierce Strike, Dwarven Might. Build the body you need.",
  ],
  "quest.3EC0F38A5F8D01E2.title": "Raise the Ara Vitae",
  "quest.1E2F0E34FF11233F.quest_desc": [
    "The &cHighway to Hell&r ritual tears open a permanent gate to the &cEndless Realm&r.",
    "",
    "Come armed and armored; the realm does not suffer the unprepared.",
    "",
    "As you progress you will see a message about a rift opening or creatures stirring in the depth. This means new door types will begin to be available like the mines entrance. Make sure to select those keys when opening whenever available. ",
  ],
  "quest.11284BF46CEB2F12.title": "Alchemy of Ore",
  "quest.6639F7B976053020.title": "Blood Patterns",
  "quest.1A22280295ED9A42.title": "The Crucible's Greed",
  "quest.40B51E2F7CFBF442.quest_desc": [
    "Lay a &bDiamond&r upon the bare altar and let the EV transfigure it into your first &cNovicius Orb of Vitae&r.",
    "",
    "Bind it to yourself by right-clicking with it in hand. From then on you offer your own blood at will. Right-click the bound orb. Near an altar the blood flows into the basin; away from one it is stored in the orb to carry and pour in later.",
  ],
  "quest.50941BEEA38BE2C9.quest_desc": [
    "The ultimate Ara Vitae. &cCrystal Clusters&r crown its pillars; an immense ring of runes girds its foundation. Capacity and crafting power without equal, and the &cDivinus Orb of Vitae&r to wield it.",
    "",
    "You came asking what power costs. Now you know. Everything, paid a drop at a time, until the asking and the answering are the same act.",
  ],
  "quest.53F28C95FE1BAF29.quest_desc": [
    "Eight runes laid around the altar make it &cTier I&r. Begin with &cBlank Runes&r, then inscribe them with a purpose such as capacity, speed, or sacrifice.",
    "",
    "While at Tier I you may hold an Orb in your off-hand and kill creatures to harvest EV straight into your Anima, sparing your own veins.",
  ],
  "quest.191E3A2225AD70FA.quest_desc": [
    "Bind an iron piece on a Binding array with a charged gem and the metal wakes up. &cSentient Armor&r starts humble, with a hundred points of room to grow and a long memory.",
    "",
    "The chestplate banks everything you do, from blows taken to miles walked and blocks broken.",
  ],
  "quest.3F637FF7658CCA33.title": "&cSigils of Animus",
  "quest.7CB8720F0CADDD66.quest_desc": [
    "A Lesser gem holds four times what a Petty one does, and the next gem asks for nearly all of it.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cCommon Spiritus Gem&r from it. It holds 1,024 Spiritus.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The forge's gem needs 240 Spiritus for this recipe, nearly all a Lesser gem can hold, and the craft uses 50.",
  ],
  "quest.457CAD80D2F1DAF4.title": "Undying Tools",
  "quest.3FF43BAE10A1FE28.quest_desc": [
    "Each inscription tool sets the rune of a placed Ritual Stone. This one makes &cDeus Ritual Stones&r.",
    "",
    "Infuse a &cPrismatic Spiritus Gem&r on a Tier V Ara Vitae to make an &cInscription Tool: Deus&r. It takes 50,000 EV.",
  ],
  "quest.60CD135658A813E5.quest_desc": [
    "A &cFragile Activation Crystal&r is a single-use crystal from a Tier II Ara Vitae.",
    "",
    "Bind it like any other crystal and use it on a Master Ritual Stone. It shatters once the ritual activates, which suits a ritual you only need to start once.",
  ],
  "quest.31BF04D4FDB8DC2F.quest_desc": [
    "The &cTabula Vitae&r is your first alchemical bench. With an Orb of Vitae placed inside, it draws EV from your Anima to brew &cArcane Scribe Tools&r, sigil reagents, early anointments, and 2x ore processing recipes.",
    "",
    "Build it; the rest of the craft opens from here.",
  ],
  "quest.5F8C0F8D4270F154.quest_desc": [
    "Blackpowder cut with Spiritus.",
    "",
    "Forge &cSpirit Powder&r in the &cHellfire Forge&r and slot it into a gun. Every creature it hits is caught in a Soul Snare, and monsters killed while snared drop Spiritus.",
    "",
    "Its shots also grow stronger with the Spiritus in your gems, from +20% damage at 16 Spiritus up to +80% at 4,000, measured by your strongest aspect.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The forge's gem needs at least 300 Spiritus for this recipe, so a Common Spiritus Gem or better.",
  ],
  "quest.124509FFC6717603.title": "A Sense for Anima",
  "quest.393324AF2EE55949.title": "Enchantment Salvaging",
  "quest.0D0A1E61C2384E37.title": "The Five Aspects",
  "quest.0E3D0533331945A1.quest_subtitle": "A sluggish heart serves only a small body.",
  "quest.5E9540650EA59208.title": "&cBlood Bullets",
  "quest.2C9A224C8B8436BB.title": "The Mines",
  "quest.22AE6BD2B6F44124.quest_desc": [
    "Two blood systems in one pack is two blood systems too many to keep separate.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cSanguine Rectifier&r in the &cHellfire Forge&r to link them. With a bound Orb of Vitae on it, it turns your network's EV into &eEvilCraft Blood&r, and EvilCraft Blood piped into it goes straight into your &cAra Vitae&r.",
    "",
    "&7&oIf you've been running the EvilCraft chapter alongside this one, this is where the two finally meet.&r",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "- Place the rectifier within 10 blocks of an Ara Vitae. It links to the altar on its own, and Sneak + Right-click with an empty hand searches again.",
    "- Right-click it with a &cbound&r Orb of Vitae. The orb floats above the block, and Right-click with an empty hand takes it back.",
    "- Put a fluid tank from any mod next to it. It fills with Blood from your network at 1 EV per mB, 100 mB a tick at base and faster with Speed Runes on the altar.",
    "- To go the other way, pipe EvilCraft Blood into the rectifier. It feeds the linked altar at four times the altar's normal rate.",
  ],
  "quest.714730CCF0AC9FD6.quest_desc": [
    "A slate is nothing until the altar makes it something. Transmute &7deepslate&r into &cTabula Rasa&r on the Ara Vitae.",
    "",
    "It is the substrate for almost every sigil you will ever scribe.",
  ],
  "quest.0154D0F30F095E63.quest_desc": [
    "Crystal Catalyst can accelerate the growth of a similarly aspected crystal cluster. So if you use a raw catalyst on a raw crystal it will grow substantially faster. If you use an aspected catalyst however it will change the type of the growing crystal into the new aspected type.",
  ],
  "quest.19E98C84733A5532.title": "Early Blood Automation",
  "quest.7CB8720F0CADDD66.title": "Common Ground",
  "quest.5DE88B0427A5B039.title": "Tier III: The Master's Orb",
  "quest.3198863667151E85.title": "&cImperfect Rites",
  "quest.208FAEEF1560A473.title": "&cSentient Bow &cand Shield",
  "quest.3FF43BAE10A1FE28.title": "Inscription Tool: Deus",
  "task.2A007083FA537679.title": "Sentient Evolution",
  "quest.3BB1A111D7035936.title": "The Apprentice's Orb",
  "quest.6639F7B976053020.quest_desc": [
    "&eBloodMagic Additions&r lets an AE2 network run Ara Vitae and Tabula Vitae recipes. It starts with the &aBlood Pattern&r, which you encode in a Pattern Encoding Terminal like any other pattern.",
    "",
    "Each pattern holds one altar or alchemy table recipe, and the crafts draw Essentia Vitae from fluid storage on your network.",
  ],
  "quest.7CB9F4716DEA240C.quest_desc": [
    "Where spiritus runs thickest, the &cCrystallarium Maleficum&r seeds a cluster. This new cluster will grow over time by absorbing spiritus of its type from the Aura. You can move the cluster off the Crystallarium once it forms to allow more to grow. ",
    "",
    "The aura must be fully saturated with 100 of that type or the crystal will not grow!",
  ],
  "quest.1DF25DE313F5EA9D.quest_desc": [
    "Trees born of sacrifice. &aBlood Saplings&r grow into &2Blood Wood&r, and the fruit is what you actually want.",
    "",
    "A &cBlood Apple&r generates &bEssentia Vitae&r when eaten. The EV goes into your &cAnima&r, or straight into a nearby &cAra Vitae&r if one is in range, so an orchard is a slow but entirely passive way to keep an altar topped up.",
    "",
    "The &cBlood Core&r is the heart of the whole thing. Right-click it to toggle it on and it hunts for grass and dirt nearby, plants saplings and forces them to full growth, spreading a blood forest around itself over time.",
    "",
    "Every grown Blood Tree has one. Mine it with &bSilk Touch&r or it drops as plain Blood Wood.",
    "",
    "&7&oCarry a bound Key of Binding while eating apples and the EV goes to that key's owner instead. It's the easiest way to fill a teammate's network for them.&r",
  ],
  "quest.4E97A41B8084EC3C.title": "Divinus Activation Crystal",
  "quest.402B2E08A12381D4.quest_desc": [
    "A &cPetty Spiritus Gem&r holds only 64 Spiritus, and the stronger workings of the &cHellfire Forge&r ask for more than that.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cLesser Spiritus Gem&r. It holds 256 Spiritus, and every gem above it is forged from the one below.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The forge's gem needs at least 60 Spiritus for this recipe, and the craft uses 20 of it.",
  ],
  "quest.58503249A5084026.title": "Activate the Crystallum Fractura Ritual",
  "quest.4DD1E69D596D190F.title": "The Blood Assembler",
  "quest.40B51E2F7CFBF442.title": "Bind a Novicius Orb",
  "quest.2E5484E8811384DA.quest_desc": [
    "Saturated Tau, worked through the Athanor, condenses into a &cWeak Blood Shard&r.",
    "",
    "Each shard makes four &cBloodstone Bricks&r, the caps for the Tier III pillars. Shards also go into stronger anointments and potion catalysts, and gate everything beyond.",
  ],
  "quest.4FB5C89723323FA1.quest_desc": [
    "A &cSentient Sword&r harvests Spiritus far more efficiently than a thrown dagger, and grows stronger the more will you feed it.",
    "",
    "An optional but potent early investment.",
  ],
  "quest.1AB874D6EADDB75D.title": "Blank Runes",
  "quest.0AF4B9B8EABB8F9B.quest_desc": [
    "Throwing daggers are fine for a fight you can already win. &cJavelins&r are the heavier answer, and they come in iron, diamond, sentient and soul-bound.",
    "",
    "The &cBound Javelin&r is the capstone. Deactivated it behaves like a diamond javelin; sneak and right-click to wake it up.",
    "",
    "Activated it costs 50 EV per attack or throw and in exchange it gains melee damage in a 5 block radius, becomes unbreakable and fireproof, and &csacrifices&r any enemy that dies near an &cAra Vitae&r, killing it outright and feeding the EV straight back to the altar.",
    "",
    "&7&oFighting next to your own altar stops being a liability and starts being the point.&r",
  ],
  "quest.1CE38D8CD1B5CA50.title": "The Sigil Catalog",
  "quest.76CE17956D6DA7A1.title": "Circle of Intent",
  "quest.50941BEEA38BE2C9.quest_subtitle": "What you do with that power is yours to decide.",
  "quest.0A7737571F027A95.title": "Tier IV: The Archmage's Orb",
  "quest.53F28C95FE1BAF29.title": "Tier I: The Ring of Runes",
  "quest.3CA9125C16DD3124.quest_desc": [
    "While nodes autoconnect when placed, if you want to manually reconnect nodes to a different master routing node you can use the node router tool.",
  ],
  "quest.2D254A8045093FED.quest_desc": [
    "The &cHellfire Forge&r is fueled by &cSpiritus&r, the residue you tear from creatures wounded by your daggers.",
    "",
    "From it come &cSpiritus Gems&r, &cSentient Tools&r, explosive charges, and more. It will be hungry.",
  ],
  "quest.4F21AE8F87333085.quest_desc": [
    "Tau Oil is a refining reagent. It upgrades your Athanor's Cutting Fluid from Basic to Intermediate, and it is the base for the extended and greater anointments that keep your blades and bows potent far longer. ",
    "",
    "It also lets you make Spiritus Catalysts which can coax Spiritus Crystals into growing. ",
  ],
  "quest.557EBAB98F32B85F.quest_desc": [
    "Not everything must die slowly. &cThrowing Daggers&r are your early ranged weapon and the seed of the Spiritus economy.",
    "",
    "A creature wounded by a dagger sheds &cRaw Spiritus&r when it dies; keep what falls.",
  ],
  "quest.78481F52005467B2.title": "The Greater Gem",
  "quest.2E5484E8811384DA.title": "The Weak Blood Shard",
  "quest.143B171B2AE08145.quest_desc": [
    "Perform &cBreaching the Edge of Demon Realm&r and you tear a one-time wound in the veil, building an &cAntechamber&r on the far side.",
    "",
    "Step through. Bring keys, or the means to find them.",
  ],
  "quest.7C9C13B714FC8ADA.quest_desc": [
    "A Deus circle is a lot of stones to place by hand.",
    "",
    "Craft a &cRitual Diviner [Deus]&r. It lays out Deus rituals and inscribes their &cDeus Ritual Stones&r as it goes.",
  ],
  "quest.3BDF260175FFE44F.quest_desc": [
    "Demonite refines into &cHellforged Ingots&r, the spine of every endgame thing you will ever build.",
  ],
  "quest.48784773302B05B5.title": "The Tau Harvest",
  "quest.1AB874D6EADDB75D.quest_desc": [
    "Every &cAltar&r tier past the first is counted in runes, and they all start blank.",
    "",
    "Twenty-four of them ring the altar for &9Tier II&r, and the number only climbs from there. Set up a steady supply now rather than crafting them a handful at a time.",
  ],
  "quest.1CE38D8CD1B5CA50.quest_desc": [
    "Every Tabula Vitae reagent is a sigil waiting to happen. Water that never runs dry, lava on demand, a void that swallows fluids, haste, magnetism, hastened growth.",
    "",
    "Scribe the trades that suit you.",
  ],
  "quest.2507A7FD69022F2C.title": "The Aura Between Worlds",
  "task.553A5E5210050F3F.title": "The Blank Slate",
  "quest.6181B4122A7D40D9.quest_desc": [
    "The Sentient Evolution ritual stops at 500 Upgrade Points. The Deus form goes further.",
    "",
    "Stand on a &cDeus Sentient Evolution&r ritual in Sentient Armor that already holds 500 Upgrade Points. Its capacity rises to 600, and every piece of Sentient Armor you wear is bound with &cBlood Mending&r.",
  ],
  "quest.393324AF2EE55949.quest_desc": [
    "Enchantments are woven things, and what is woven can be unpicked. ",
    "",
    "Load the Athanor with a stack of plain Books and a single enchanted item such as armor, a tool, or even an Enchanted Book and the crucible lifts one enchantment at a time onto a fresh book, drawing it cleanly off the item. ",
    "",
    "Salvage a wasted enchant, or peel a prize apart to reforge it as you please.",
  ],
  "quest.7C9C13B714FC8ADA.title": "Ritual Diviner [Deus]",
  "quest.530F5E2E4ADB1BA4.quest_desc": [
    "If altar construction starts to drag, the &bPotion Crafting&r system opens at Tier I. Brew &cAlchemy Flasks&r or tip &dAmethyst Throwing Daggers&r with dozens of effects.",
    "",
    "A Vitaemancer with a well-stocked flask belt is never truly in danger!",
  ],
  "quest.0AF4B9B8EABB8F9B.title": "&cJavelins",
  "quest.5EDFD69BB6601872.title": "Raising the Assembler",
  "quest.5A2BA6A54F83E1BB.title": "&cThe Sanguine Diviner",
  "quest.1DF25DE313F5EA9D.title": "&cBlood Trees",
  "quest.1FB8BF0898FD99D9.title": "Tier II: The Magician's Orb",
  "quest.143B171B2AE08145.title": "Breaching the Veil",
  "quest.297703FC2EBF8CD8.quest_desc": [
    "Crystals don't grow from nothing; they grow out of the Spiritus Aura, an invisible miasma measured per chunk, capped at 100 per Aspect.",
    "",
    "Fill a chunk's Aura by burning Spiritus in a Vas Maleficum (feed it a charged gem, loose Spiritus, or crystals of any Aspect).",
    "",
    "Read the local concentration with a Spiritus Aura Gauge (sneak for exact 0-100 numbers per Aspect).",
  ],
  "quest.5A2BA6A54F83E1BB.quest_desc": [
    "Infuse a Ritual Diviner on a Tier I Ara Vitae to make a &cSanguine Diviner&r.",
    "",
    "Right-click an Ara Vitae with it to see the altar's tier, Essentia Vitae and bonuses. While you hold it and look at the altar, it shows the blocks the next tier needs, and Sneak + Right-click places them from your inventory.",
    "",
    "On a Master Ritual Stone it names the ritual and its status, and Sneak + Right-click shuts the ritual down.",
  ],
  "quest.124509FFC6717603.quest_desc": [
    "Your first sigil comes from the Alchemy Array. The &cDivination Sigil&r reads the well of Anima within you and the EV held in an altar before you.",
    "",
    "The &cSeer's Sigil&r reads an altar in detail, showing its progress, EV per tick, and charge reserve. Invaluable when building toward higher tiers.",
    "",
    "You cannot manage what you cannot measure.",
  ],
  "quest.5DE88B0427A5B039.quest_desc": [
    "Fifty-two runes and four more pillars crowned in &cBloodstone Brick&r raise the altar to &cTier III&r.",
    "",
    "Here you forge the &cMagus Orb of Vitae&r, and the &cRitual Diviner [Dusk]&r.",
  ],
  "quest.1A885C9475D37138.title": "The Prismatic Spiritus Gem",
  "quest.1CE38D8CD1B5CA50.quest_subtitle": "Any one will do; collect them all in time.",
  "quest.4DD1E69D596D190F.quest_desc": [
    "The &dBlood Assembler&r is an AE2 crafting provider for Blood Patterns. Put your patterns in it and the network can order altar and alchemy crafts like any other autocraft.",
    "",
    "Each craft takes 200 ticks. Speed cards bring that down to a minimum of 20, and one &aBlood Speed Card&r counts as four Acceleration Cards.",
  ],
  "quest.1A885C9475D37138.quest_desc": [
    "Raw, Ruina, Nihilum, Vindicta and Invictus, all bound at once around a Nether Star.",
    "",
    "Make a &cPrismatic Spiritus Gem&r in the &cAthanor&r with your &cDivinus Orb of Vitae&r in the tool slot. The orb guides the work and is not used up.",
    "",
    "The chunk must hold 30 of every Spiritus, and all of it is used up when the gem is done. Every Deus item starts from this gem, and most of them consume one, so plan on making several.",
  ],
  "quest.5F8C0F8D4270F154.title": "&cSpirit Powder",
  "quest.4FB5C89723323FA1.title": "Sentient Steel",
  "quest.2C9A224C8B8436BB.quest_desc": [
    "Past a Spatial Distortion lies the entrance to the &cMines&r. &cMine Dungeon Keys&r open the way inward, toward the veins of Demonite.",
    "",
    "The Daemonium that haunt these halls are no reskinned villagers. Learn them by killing them.",
  ],
  "quest.2CB3745D96885DED.title": "Tabula Aetherea",
  "quest.19A36A138537D911.title": "&6The Deus Rituals",
  "quest.470284891D9DBE29.title": "Sentient Spear",
  "quest.58503249A5084026.quest_desc": [
    "The Crystallum Fractura is ideal for automating will. It will double the speed that crystals of all types grow at and will automatically harvest them when grown. ",
    "",
    "For each fully-grown crystal in range that it can afford it applies scaling Fortune based on the chunk's Raw Spiritus when harvesting.",
  ],
  "quest.0D0A1E61C2384E37.quest_subtitle": "Any one aspect proves the craft.",
  "quest.067E4D25501B94F3.title": "Rites and Rituals",
  "quest.60CD135658A813E5.title": "&cFragile Activation Crystal",
  "quest.3BB1A111D7035936.quest_desc": [
    "The Novicius Orb runs dry too fast. The &cDiscipulus Orb of Vitae&r holds more and draws faster, befitting a hand that no longer trembles at the cut.",
  ],
  "quest.1A22280295ED9A42.quest_desc": [
    "Run an ore block through the full Athanor chain to ingots; and use Corrupted Dust with Ore Fragments in the Tabula Vitae to double them into Ore Gravel. If you fully max out the spiritus and processing cycle of corrupted dust you can take ore to ingot at over 8x the output of normal smelting!",
  ],
  "quest.165A563C9EFE232B.quest_desc": [
    "A flask holds an effect for you. A &bTipped Throwing Dagger&r delivers that effect to someone else's throat.",
  ],
  "quest.25E6EEE74D627857.quest_desc": [
    "Every Deus forging in the &cHellfire Forge&r needs 5,000 Spiritus in the forge's gem, more than a Greater gem can hold.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cGrand Spiritus Gem&r. It holds 16,384 Spiritus.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The forge's gem needs 4,000 Spiritus for this recipe, nearly a full Greater gem. The craft uses 400.",
  ],
  "quest.3F263702F010167A.quest_desc": [
    "At the heart of every Vitaemancer's workings is a leyline of magical routing nodes. These act as the piping and transmission controls for fluids, items and even energy. It all starts with a master routing node which controls the entire network.",
    "",
    "Create some routing nodes and an input/output node then start your network by first placing the master routing node and the other nodes will connect to it as you place them. ",
  ],
  "task.7089A01D8E2F8FE4.title": "Any Enchanted Book",
  "quest.0D0A1E61C2384E37.quest_desc": [
    "Raw will bends to purpose. With a catalyst and an &cAnimus Mote&r drawn from a Daemonium Animaris, a Raw cluster becomes one of four aspects, each its own cruelty and each reshaping how your Sentient Tools behave.",
    "",
    "- &cRuina&r",
    "- &cNihilum&r",
    "- &cVindicta&r",
    "- &cInvictus&r",
  ],
  "quest.6181B4122A7D40D9.title": "Deus Sentient Evolution",
  "quest.25E6EEE74D627857.title": "The Grand Spiritus Gem",
  "quest.4E97A41B8084EC3C.quest_desc": [
    "Deus rituals are woken with a &cDivinus Activation Crystal&r.",
    "",
    "First infuse a Weak Activation Crystal into an &cAwakened Activation Crystal&r on a Tier IV Ara Vitae, which takes 40,000 EV. Then forge the Awakened crystal with a Prismatic Spiritus Gem in the &cHellfire Forge&r.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The Awakened crystal keeps the binding of the Weak crystal you started from.",
  ],
  "quest.402B2E08A12381D4.title": "A Larger Vessel",
  "quest.3BDF260175FFE44F.title": "Hellforged Steel",
  "quest.24E04D4C7C3E7CA4.quest_desc": [
    "Mine the veins the Foreman guarded. &cDemonite&r is the only honest source of Hellforged metal, the capstone material for the ultimate altar tiers.",
  ],
  "quest.76CE17956D6DA7A1.quest_desc": [
    "Brew an &cArcane Scribe Tool&r in the Tabula Vitae.",
    "",
    "Strike the ground with it and a circle of power awakens, the &cAlchemy Array&r. It accepts two offerings. Some combinations yield crafted objects, others invoke immediate effects upon the world.",
  ],
  "quest.5E12FC7FD8720FBA.quest_desc": [
    "Something runs the Mines, and it does not clock out. The &cForeman&r is a Daemonium Doloris swollen with authority, six hundred hearts of spite and a key no one else carries.",
    "",
    "Take the &cMine Entrance Key&r from him.",
  ],
  "quest.7CB9F4716DEA240C.quest_subtitle": "The crystalline cradle",
  "quest.11284BF46CEB2F12.quest_desc": [
    "Brew a measure of &cCutting Fluid&r in your Tabula Vitae, then dissolve an ore within it. The slab grinds the metal free of its stone into dust, two for every ore you offer; smelt that into finished ingots.",
  ],
  "quest.6C79D3E7AD6D6766.title": "Wear It In",
  "quest.263045D3780542C0.title": "The Athanor",
  "quest.3C6ED87712D41C45.quest_desc": [
    "&eAnimus&r is an addon for &eNeoVitae&r. It doesn't replace anything you've already learned; it bolts extra Vitaemancy onto the same &cAra Vitae&r and the same &aEssentia Vitae&r you're already producing.",
    "",
    "The &2Codex Animus&r documents all of it, from new sigils and imperfect rites to blood trees, javelins and sentient gear.",
    "",
    "&7&oCraft it early. Most of what follows assumes you have it open.&r",
  ],
  "quest.0154D0F30F095E63.title": "Coaxing Crystals",
  "quest.50941BEEA38BE2C9.title": "Tier V: The Pinnacle",
  "quest.78481F52005467B2.quest_desc": [
    "Some Hellfire Forge recipes, such as the Crystal Cluster, need more Spiritus than a Common gem can hold.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cGreater Spiritus Gem&r. It holds 4,096 Spiritus.",
    "",
    "&eNote&r: The forge's gem needs 1,000 Spiritus for this recipe, so fill your Common gem before you start. The craft uses 100.",
  ],
  "quest.229B331555E15B4A.quest_desc": [
    "With the Dusk Diviner, the &cRitual of Sentient Evolution&r raises your armor's cap from 100 to 300 points. The &cSentient Extraction&r ritual strips upgrades into Tomes you can bank in a &cTraining Bracelet&r.",
  ],
  "quest.557EBAB98F32B85F.title": "Throwing Daggers",
  "quest.48784773302B05B5.quest_desc": [
    "Strange fruit grows in the Antechamber. &cWeak Tau&r is a seed of the demon realm's vitality.",
    "",
    "Carry it home and cultivate it.",
    "",
    "Cultivated and saturated, Weak Tau ripens into &cStrong Tau&r, dense enough to refine.",
    "",
    "To grow this you must allow it to grow with animals walking on it. They will be damaged over time and each time there is a chance the Tau becomes saturated and evolves into Strong Tau. ",
  ],
  "quest.263045D3780542C0.quest_desc": [
    "Tau alone is potential. The &cAthanor&r refines it, pressing &cTau Oil&r and saturating fruit into the shards a higher altar demands.",
    "",
    "Build the furnace of the patient alchemist.",
  ],
  "quest.3F263702F010167A.title": "Laying the Veins",
  "quest.470284891D9DBE29.quest_desc": [
    "Not every Sentient weapon is a blade.",
    "",
    "Forge a &cSentient Spear&r in the &cHellfire Forge&r. It jabs and charges like a Netherite Spear with half a point less damage, and like the Sentient Sword it grows stronger with the Spiritus you carry.",
  ],
  "quest.5E9540650EA59208.quest_desc": [
    "Ammunition runs out. Your network usually does not.",
    "",
    "Infuse an &cEnchanted Bullet Modifier&r on a Tier I Ara Vitae to make a &cBlood Bullet&r, then slot it into a gun. Each shot draws 50 EV from your network in place of a bullet, so the gun reloads even if you don't have bullets.",
    "",
    "When the network cannot pay, the gun falls back on whatever bullets you have to reload with.",
  ],
  "quest.24E04D4C7C3E7CA4.title": "Demonite",
  "quest.0A7737571F027A95.quest_desc": [
    "A hundred runes and corners of Hellforged Block raise the altar to &cTier IV&r, home of the &cDominus Orb of Vitae&r and the most destructive rites in all of Vitaemancy.",
  ],
  "quest.0E3D0533331945A1.quest_desc": [
    "Forge a Master Routing Node Core to widen the veins of your network. It will allow more items/liquid/energy to be carried with every transmission, and a Speed Core to quicken frequency of transmissions. Seat them within the Master Routing Node, and stack as many as your ambition demands. A network so driven will move oceans in moments.",
  ],
  "quest.067E4D25501B94F3.quest_desc": [
    "A ritual needs a heart. Lay a &cMaster Ritual Stone&r at the center, mark the lesser stones around it with the &cRitual Diviner&r, and ignite the working with a &cWeak Activation Crystal&r.",
    "",
    "From the Well of Suffering to Overgrowth to the Endless Quarry, the circle does the labor you would otherwise bleed for.",
    "",
    "The &aRitual Configurator&r lets you define the range and area a ritual works in.",
  ],
  "quest.53F28C95FE1BAF29.quest_subtitle": "Altar Upgrade",
  "quest.2CB3745D96885DED.quest_desc": [
    "Late Vitaemancy runs on a stronger slate.",
    "",
    "Transmute a Tabula Spiritus into a &cTabula Aetherea&r on a Tier IV Ara Vitae. It takes 30,000 EV.",
    "",
    "The Crystal Clusters that crown the Tier V pillars are forged with it, and so are the Grand Spiritus Gem, the Deus tools and the Ritual Diviner [Deus].",
  ],
  "quest.1E2F0E34FF11233F.title": "Highway to Hell",
  "quest.19E98C84733A5532.quest_desc": [
    "The spike trap will provide blood to the altar when it damages entities within 8 blocks of an Ara Vitae. Craft one to begin gathering blood passively. You'll need some way to provide enemies such as a mob spawner or other means. ",
    "",
    "A Vortex Array on top is a perfect way to gather the mobs and a collection array nearby can grab the drops.",
  ],
  "quest.208FAEEF1560A473.quest_desc": [
    "The &cHellfire Forge&r makes more than a sword.",
    "",
    "The &cSentient Bow&r drops &dSpiritus&r matching your attuned type every time it kills something, so it feeds the same loop your sword does at range.",
    "",
    "The &cSentient Shield&r has four times the durability of an ordinary shield, &c1,344&r against &c336&r, and applies an effect when you block based on which &dSpiritus&r you have available.",
    "",
    "It also raises the &dSpiritus&r you gain from &aevery&r source by &c30%&r just by being held in either hand, which makes it worth carrying even when nothing is shooting at you.",
  ],
  "quest.3C6ED87712D41C45.title": "&cThe Codex Animus",
  "quest.457CAD80D2F1DAF4.quest_desc": [
    "The Athanor wears through its tools. Each one has a Deus counterpart that never wears out.",
    "",
    "Forge any &cDeus tool&r in the &cHellfire Forge&r from the best tool of its kind, a Prismatic Spiritus Gem and a Tabula Aetherea. The forge's gem has to hold at least 5,000 Spiritus, so it needs a Grand Spiritus Gem.",
    "",
    "Instead of durability, a Deus tool draws 50 EV from its owner's network each time it completes an Athanor or Tabula Vitae operation.",
  ],
  "quest.6F13D27CE61DC87A.quest_desc": [
    "Hellforged parts will allow you to maximize your runes. Upgrading them with hellforged parts will double the value they previously provided to your altar.",
  ],
}